    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opposing player's Movement phase, right after an enemy unit completes a Normal move, an Advance move or a Fall Back move. Pick one ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY or ADEPTUS ASTARTES MOUNTED unit of yours that lies within 8\" of that enemy unit and has no enemy unit within Engagement Range of it. It may then move up to D6\" as a Normal move, or up to 6\" if the Tactical Doctrine applies to it.",
